{"addGuestsHandler lowercases BLACKLISTED_GUEST_EMAILS but compares against the raw guest email without normalization, so blacklisted addresses can bypass via casing": 0.9806586503982544, "addGuestsHandler computes isTeamAdminOrOwner using an AND of isTeamAdmin and isTeamOwner, which effectively requires OWNER and blocks non-owner ADMINs from adding guests, causing legitimate team admins to get FORBIDDEN for team bookings": 0.9734814167022705, "addGuestsHandler calls sendAddGuestsEmails with the raw input guests instead of the actually-added uniqueGuests, causing existing attendees included in input to potentially receive the wrong email type": 0.9653486013412476, "addGuestsHandler does not deduplicate guest inputs or compare attendee emails case-insensitively, allowing duplicate attendee rows to be created": 0.9651382565498352, "addGuestsHandler authorizes any existing attendee (email match) to add more guests, allowing a participant to invite arbitrary external emails, which is inconsistent with other booking mutations that only authorize organizer/collective-host access": 0.9229101538658142}